# bug-group-screen-blank-after-back (UserApp, post-placement group screen "Orders from multiple stores")
Repro (2/2): place a 2-store group (same-module, COD) -> app lands on the group screen listing children with View details / Cancel Order -> tap View details on a child -> Back.
Result: screen renders a near-uniform light-grey blank (dominant px (240,224,224)/(224,224,224), no dark text) and the a11y tree has 0 labelled nodes (dump archived: bug-group-screen-a11y-empty-after-back.xml, package com.izzes.nears.nears_nears_3860_qa). Persists > 60 s and after a scroll nudge; leaving via Back/Home recovers.
Positive control: the same screen's dump immediately before View details listed 'The Grill House\nPending\n#91584', 'NEARS-3858 QA Mixed Kitchen\nPending\n#91585', 'View details', 'Cancel Order' (instrument live).
Runs: flag OFF group 405017b4 (91421/91422, 01:00); flag ON group a3082595 (91584/91585, 03:12). No [FAIL]/[ERR]/exception logged (silent).
